@Template.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7224

### Health Check
GET {{Template.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Register
POST {{Template.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser051426",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### Sign In
POST {{Template.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUsername": "testuser051426",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### Validate Session
POST {{Template.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "731d4c83-1ea6-4433-9c19-84803c063de9"
}

### Get Profile (requires X-Session-Id header)
GET {{Template.Api_HostAddress}}/api/profile
X-Session-Id: 731d4c83-1ea6-4433-9c19-84803c063de9

### Get Admin Status
GET {{Template.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/me
X-Session-Id: 731d4c83-1ea6-4433-9c19-84803c063de9

